WEBVTT

00:00:30.526 --> 00:00:33.738
As physicians, we took
a sacred oath to do no harm.

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:36.449
And the system has gone
to great lengths to teach us

00:00:36.491 --> 00:00:41.412
and set up guidelines to make sure
that we treat every patient equally

00:00:41.454 --> 00:00:42.872
and without judgment.

00:00:43.623 --> 00:00:46.084
As we stand there in your moment of pain,

00:00:46.125 --> 00:00:50.088
we run your situation
through every filter we have

00:00:50.129 --> 00:00:52.673
to give you the best care.

00:00:53.674 --> 00:00:55.468
And for most of us,

00:00:55.510 --> 00:00:57.428
this is more than just a job.

00:00:57.804 --> 00:00:59.013
It's a calling.